invariant: INV-5
file: pem.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: the bundle's scan looks for the whole BEGIN CERTIFICATE line, as
  it did before Camilo ruled on 2026-10-13. So a block under another
  label is text. A bundle that holds a TRUSTED CERTIFICATE or X509
  CERTIFICATE block then decodes without that root and reports CH_OK
  (docs/decisions.md 131). test_bundle_grammar writes each label beside
  a root and requires CH_EINVAL.

--- old
    return match_bytes(&peek, begin_prefix, sizeof begin_prefix);
--- new
    return match_line(&peek, begin_prefix, sizeof begin_prefix, PEM_LABEL_CERTIFICATE);
